  (console command, PNG pictures, colour commands, VESA console for BIOS); tools/ipxe/build.sh makes the files. ipxe.efi (SHA-256
  78354cdf81434498aabfad6fb5c1177691ee1daaf1489cd9dbdd1ccd199409b4), snponly.efi (SHA-256
  a94d1db7f1b2cfa10b87faef67d95572618ba04bce286a3da003609a3c0dca90), undionly.kpxe (SHA-256
  7391a65312f9719374e4d872c60c6eaebabfbea5d69edaa16e7d23701a27e9d5). They are unsigned: UEFI Secure Boot must be off for them (see issue #10).
